    - target: {fileID: 6571516543653104596, guid: 541bbf424a499cd4c8a115d83957583d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The boss lets a paper fall from his bag.


        Boss: Why, look!
        There was one job you missed, seems like you lost! I''ll have to fire you
        after all!


        protagonist: ...what?


        hundreds of ghosts suddenly
        appear


        Ghost: It''s better this way.


        Ghost: Yeah, dude.
        We were trying to tell you that it would be best for you to get fired from
        this shady company, but you wouldn''t listen to us on that coffee-induced
        frenzy of yours.


        Ghost 1: You need to drink less coffee, or else
        you''re going to have a heart attack.


        Protagonist: ... too late
        for that.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
