  m_text: "Ghost: ...now what?\r\n\r\nProtagonist: Well, this company needs a new
    boss, I might as well take the spot.\r\n\r\nGhost: Alright, guess we can work
    for you then, not like we've anything else to do after all.\r\n\r\nGhost: What
    did this company do again by the way? It's... been a while since some of us died...\r\n\r\nProtagonist:
    To be honest, I'm not sure. All I've been doing lately is solving mazes, typing
    random words, and moving a ball around.\r\n\r\nGhost: Huh....\r\n\r\nGhost: Besides,
    this place is pretty worn down.\r\n\r\nGhosts: And it's haunted too! How spooky!\r\n\r\nProtagonist:
    Well, at least this place's coffee is pretty good\u2026"
